      "name": "Orthogenic Pulse",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/magic/unholy/silhouette-robe-evil-power.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Diane releases a biological rewrite wave. All living creatures within 20 ft must succeed on a DC 23 Constitution saving throw. On a failure, one ability score of Diane's choice is reduced by 4 for 1 hour. On a success, speed is halved until the end of the creature's next turn. Plant-type creatures and orthogenic undead are instead healed for 2d10 hit points.</p>",
          "chat": ""
