      "name": "Arcane Correction",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/magic/unholy/silhouette-robe-evil-power.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Diane permanently alters the biology of one willing or incapacitated creature within 5 ft. She may grant or remove a trait with a CR value equal to her proficiency bonus (7). This alteration cannot be dispelled, counterspelled, or removed by Remove Curse. At DM's discretion, it may manifest subtle aesthetic changes: geometric patterns on skin, altered eye color, or a faint smell of lavender and earth.</p>",
