      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Diane analyzes one creature she can see. Until the start of her next turn, she has advantage on attack rolls and spell attack rolls against that creature, and she learns its hit point maximum, one damage immunity or resistance, and whether it has been altered by any magic, curse, or Arcane Correction.</p>",
